    "Cost": 2338189,
    "UIName": "Padilla Artillery Tank",
    "Id": "vehicledef_Padilla",
    "Name": "Padilla Artillery Tank",
    "Details": "Not to be confused with the original Padilla, the Padilla Tube Artillery Tank was a Republic of the Sphere vehicle meant to fulfill a similar role. Originally designed and produced by Aldis Industries at the request of Precentor Martial Cameron St. Jamais, the Padilla Tube Artillery Tank serves as the main conventional artillery support platform used by the Republic Armed Forces. The Padilla is well-protected for a vehicle of its size. This is good as the tank's low top speed could make it an easy target for fast moving units or airstrikes.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       170     30\n<b>Left</b>         130     30\n<b>Right</b>       130     30\n<b>Rear</b>        100     30\n<b>Turret</b>      120     30\n\n<b>Total</b>      650    150</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Ballistics</color>",
    "Icon": "Padilla"
  },
